<title>UK: GOLF-WORLD INVITATIONAL LEADERBOARD AFTER TWO DAYS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD INVITATIONAL LEADERBOARD AFTER TWO DAYS.</headline>
<dateline>LUSS, Scotland 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaderboard at the end</p>
<p>of the second day in the Loch Lomond World Invitational golf</p>
<p>tournament on Thursday (British unless stated):</p>
<p>11 under - Tom Lehman (U.S.) (after 36 holes)</p>
<p>8 under - Steve Jones (U.S.) (36)</p>
<p>7 under - Paul Curry (36), Joakim Haeggman (Sweden) (36)</p>
<p>6 under - Greg Norman (Australia) (36) Stephen Field (36)</p>
<p>Ronan Rafferty (30)</p>
<p>5 under - Tom Purtzer (U.S.)(36) Stephen McAllister (36)</p>
<p>Mathias Gronberg (Sweden) (26)</p>
